</li>
<li class="no-link"><a href="#">Campus Life</a>
<div class="flyout">
<div class="row">
<div class="col four">
<h2>Live like a Statesman</h2>
<div><p>Richard Bland College is the only two-year residential college in Virginia. The residence halls were built in 2008 and offer apartment-style living with state-of-the-art amenities. Students are able to live and eat affordably starting at just $9,840 per year ranging up to $11,640 per year depending on their room assignment.</p>
</div>
</div><!--.col.four-->
